 "summary": "Proves that the cokernel and index of smooth real Cauchy\u2013Riemann operators do not depend on the exponent, which is PH6.3 item 4: `ker D_F*` is independent of `(k, q)` (README.md:1153\u20131154); the kernel half is already on main. Every supporting change feeds the new `CauchyRiemann/Exponent.lean`, so the PR is one topic: the moved and generalized nested-chart partition of unity, the chart regularity lemma generalized to an open \u03a9, the finite-measure instance, and the dense-range and chart-data lemmas.",
